    <!-- The same text as emptyChatPrivacyBody() (ChatListCopy.kt), which the privacy-claims tests pin. -->
    <string name="chat_list_privacy_body">Shielded messages travel inside Zcash transactions. Open and Tunnel messages are end-to-end encrypted and pass through three Nostr relays, one of which ZChat runs. Relays can\'t read them, but they can see your chat key, your IP address, when you\'re online, and which chat keys you send to. Relays may keep logs.</string>
